{"data": [{"author_id": "113781821", "created_at": "2026-10-25T13:01:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114341457163100400"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/IIdCXvc8L1", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Maksimoos/status/2114341457163100400/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114285536504684544", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/IIdCXvc8L1"}]}, "id": "2114341457163100400", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The U.S. Treasury General Account (TGA) is already a widely watched liquidity indicator in financial markets.\n\nBut the latest numbers are worth a closer look.\n\nAs of October 22, the TGA balance stood at approximately $962 billion.\n\nNow, consider the Treasury's borrowing estimates https://t.co/IIdCXvc8L1", "url": "https://x.com/Maksimoos/status/2114341457163100400"}, {"author_id": "2108738811685412864", "created_at": "2026-10-24T13:16:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113982982646059268"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Hq7HfnpkzZ", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/FinzData/status/2113982982646059268/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113982980775370752", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/Hq7HfnpkzZ"}]}, "id": "2113982982646059268", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "FinzData Weekly · What moved liquidity (4/11)\nFour-week changes in the components of net liquidity: Fed balance sheet +6bn; Treasury General Account +25bn; Overnight reverse repo 0bn; Bank reserves +32bn\n\nFinzData: built for AI, quants, data scientists, and financial analysts. https://t.co/Hq7HfnpkzZ", "url": "https://x.com/FinzData/status/2113982982646059268"}, {"author_id": "2097351247988654080", "created_at": "2026-10-25T13:31:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114349148107350407"], "id": "2114349148107350407", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Treasury's cash account at the Fed hit $961.8 billion Thursday, up $89 billion from Oct 9 (Treasury). The Fed's reverse repo facility held just $200 million Friday (New York Fed). With that cushion gone, every dollar Treasury piles up comes out of bank reserves.", "url": "https://x.com/overnightrate/status/2114349148107350407"}, {"author_id": "1659115509835595778", "created_at": "2026-10-25T15:27:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114378323979632969"], "id": "2114378323979632969", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🌊 Liquidity Update\n\nDollar\n\nThe broad dollar index closed at 121.40 on 16 October, below 122.00 two sessions earlier but still firm. That retreat offers some relief at the margin. It does not yet signal abundant global dollar liquidity.\n\nTreasury Yields\n\nAt the latest official", "url": "https://x.com/O4SI5/status/2114378323979632969"}, {"author_id": "203321243", "created_at": "2026-10-24T19:00:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114069417273516320"], "id": "2114069417273516320", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 38, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🏛️ Traditional Markets &amp; Macro-Liquidity: October 24, 2026\n\n📌 Key Strategic Takeaways:\n🔹 Liquidity Plumbing: A USD 52.4 billion five-day TGA build to USD 839.8 billion pulled bank reserves down USD 39.8 billion to USD 3,106.8 billion inside the ample corridor. Steady USD 15", "url": "https://x.com/Marty_Au79/status/2114069417273516320"}, {"author_id": "1533394307356532738", "created_at": "2026-10-25T10:11:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114298794078548177"], "id": "2114298794078548177", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1013, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "THE BOND MARKET ALWAYS LEADS\n\nUnder Powell, the Fed routinely reinvested rollovers and used SOMA operations ($10B to $15B weekly) to absorb Treasury issuance and keep market plumbing lubricated. Since Warsh took over, those operations have effectively gone cold.\n\nHere is the", "url": "https://x.com/SaroshQ2022/status/2114298794078548177"}, {"author_id": "203321243", "created_at": "2026-10-24T18:00:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114054315778150687"], "id": "2114054315778150687", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 55, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "⚖️ Market Intelligence Outlook Report: October 24, 2026\n\n📌 Key Strategic Takeaways:\n🔹 Macro Overview: Fed Net Liquidity fell USD 47.6 billion to USD 5,891.7 billion as the TGA reached USD 839.8 billion and bank reserves settled at USD 3,106.8 billion. Institutional desks are", "url": "https://x.com/Marty_Au79/status/2114054315778150687"}, {"author_id": "752114515060330496", "created_at": "2026-10-24T13:40:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113989046498365872"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/KrTs7YVeTu", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/leshka_eth/status/2113989046498365872/video/1", "media_key": "13_2113989011803078656", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/KrTs7YVeTu"}]}, "id": "2113989046498365872", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 8212, "like_count": 26, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "🚨 U.S. BANK RESERVES HAVE FALLEN BACK BELOW $3 TRILLION\n\nThe weekly average dropped by $59.5 billion\n\nOver the same week the Treasury’s average cash balance rose by $68.6 billion\n\nThe Fed’s next rate decision is on October 28\n\nA rate cut alone won’t put that cash back into bank https://t.co/KrTs7YVeTu", "url": "https://x.com/leshka_eth/status/2113989046498365872"}, {"author_id": "786503563371433984", "created_at": "2026-10-25T16:58:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114401107426590930"], "id": "2114401107426590930", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The Federal Reserve's overnight reverse repo facility usage dropped to just $200 million on Friday.\n\nThe multi-trillion-dollar liquidity buffer that once absorbed massive excess cash across the financial system has now virtually emptied out.", "url": "https://x.com/while_int/status/2114401107426590930"}, {"author_id": "470356223", "created_at": "2026-10-25T17:00:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114401686186025212"], "id": "2114401686186025212", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The Fed's Overnight Reverse Repo (ON RRP) facility dropped from $2.5T to near zero. This matters because it reflects a shrinking pool of liquidity in the system. When banks park less cash there, it signals tightening conditions, which can precede economic slowdowns. I built re...", "url": "https://x.com/wallstphd/status/2114401686186025212"}, {"author_id": "1538415185148448768", "created_at": "2026-10-24T14:27:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114000734106562682"], "id": "2114000734106562682", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 470, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Visitors equalise \nReserves A 1 - 1 Hesketh Bank Reserves", "url": "https://x.com/FulwoodAms1924/status/2114000734106562682"}, {"author_id": "1538415185148448768", "created_at": "2026-10-24T15:08:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114011090774380758"], "id": "2114011090774380758", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 469, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Fulwood take the l