"https://x.com/ChardSartin_com/status/2113956430202241147"}, {"author_id": "1814674057394331653", "created_at": "2026-10-25T15:07:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114373164725891342"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 257, "start": 244, "tag": "Tokenization"}, {"end": 270, "start": 258, "tag": "CrossBorder"}]}, "id": "2114373164725891342", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Project Agorá, the BIS-led test of tokenised central bank reserves and bank deposits, ran real-value trials in July: about CHF 800,000 across 17 scenarios, averaging roughly 80 seconds from initiation to settlement. Small sums, but real money. #Tokenization #CrossBorder", "url": "https://x.com/DohaThedonus/status/2114373164725891342"}, {"author_id": "1507419557169872910", "created_at": "2026-10-25T06:08:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114237669157081487"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 272, "start": 266, "tag": "Macro"}], "mentions": [{"end": 109, "id": "14096763", "start": 97, "username": "TheStalwart"}]}, "id": "2114237669157081487", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 68, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Bleakness is a sentiment lag; structural breakdown in bank reserves is the real crisis. Watching @TheStalwart—but the math is bleaker: RRP drained $400bn in 90 days while QT runs at $25bn/mo. The year-end liquidity wall will be the 'bleakest' event of the decade. 📊 #Macro", "url": "https://x.com/Evergreener1977/status/2114237669157081487"}, {"author_id": "907318825535918080", "created_at": "2026-10-24T09:09:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113920793944232432"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 235, "id": "3775010487", "start": 220, "username": "IwoAugustynski"}, {"end": 244, "id": "425721229", "start": 236, "username": "wpaczos"}, {"end": 258, "id": "1691001344138604544", "start": 245, "username": "HStojanowski"}, {"end": 269, "id": "1346854940", "start": 259, "username": "GSuteniec"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/oPDCMI4Cpb", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/LilAphasia/status/2113920793944232432/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113920723647414272", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/oPDCMI4Cpb"}, {"display_url": "x.com/ftopinion/stat…", "end": 327, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/ftopinion/status/2113236844376727831", "start": 304, "url": "https://t.co/aIFcitZFW0"}]}, "id": "2113920793944232432", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 176, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113236844376727831", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "ECB“Project Pontes” went live.Pontes makes central bank reserves available as a cash settlement asset for tokenised securities trading. It is an early step on the ECB’s broader roadmap for tokenised finance, named Appia @IwoAugustynski @wpaczos @HStojanowski @GSuteniec \"ONLY ON\" https://t.co/oPDCMI4Cpb https://t.co/aIFcitZFW0", "url": "https://x.com/LilAphasia/status/2113920793944232432"}, {"author_id": "1701915797801795584", "created_at": "2026-10-24T09:51:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113931364865376482"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 268, "start": 264, "tag": "INJ"}], "mentions": [{"end": 125, "id": "1062118922147659776", "start": 115, "username": "injective"}, {"end": 140, "id": "1749963130984423424", "start": 129, "username": "BDACSKorea"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/clcodjrkfU", "end": 292, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/felixx_78/status/2113931364865376482/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113931302651252736", "start": 269, "url": "https://t.co/clcodjrkfU"}]}, "id": "2113931364865376482", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 94, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Korea’s massive crypto market just unlocked a whole new layer.\n\